OL,6,G0300 Long Lost Family
OL,7,     FDavina McCall and Nicky Campbell
OL,8,     Ftry to help Liz, who was shocked
OL,9,     Fto discover as a young adult that
OL,10,     Fher birth mother had been a
OL,11,     Fpatient at a psychiatric hospital
OL,12,     Fwhen she was born. She knows her
OL,13,     Fmother also gave birth to a baby
OL,14,     Fboy who was adopted and now longs
OL,15,     Fto find them. Naomi was last with
OL,16,     Fher birth mother when she was six
OL,17,     Fweeks old and for most of her
OL,18,     Fadult life she has longed to meet
OL,19,     Fher. She discovered in her
OL,20,     Fadoption paperwork that her birth
OL,21,     Fmother had twin girls who were
OL,22,     Falso placed for adoption as babies
